t":"cat's"},{"key":"D","text":"cat"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"一般直接加 s，cats。","verify":"\"cats\""},{"id":"cne_p052_q2","topicId":"cne_p052","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"box 的复数是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"boxs"},{"key":"B","text":"boxies"},{"key":"C","text":"boxes"},{"key":"D","text":"box"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"以 x 结尾加 es，boxes。","verify":"\"boxes\""},{"id":"cne_p052_q3","topicId":"cne_p052","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"two dogs 里有几只狗？","answer":"2","explanation":"two 表示 2。","verify":"2"},{"id":"cne_p052_q4","topicId":"cne_p052","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句的名词是复数？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"I see three birds."},{"key":"B","text":"I see one bird."},{"key":"C","text":"I see a bird."},{"key":"D","text":"I see the bird."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"three birds 是复数。","verify":"\"I see three birds.\""},{"id":"cne_p053_q1","topicId":"cne_p053","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Do you like pears? Yes, I do. 这个人喜欢梨吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"不喜欢"},{"key":"B","text":"没说"},{"key":"C","text":"喜欢"},{"key":"D","text":"只喜欢苹果"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"回答是 Yes, I do。","verify":"\"喜欢\""},{"id":"cne_p053_q2","topicId":"cne_p053","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Do you like apples? No, I do not. 哪一句和对话一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"这个人喜欢苹果。"},{"key":"B","text":"这个人喜欢梨。"},{"key":"C","text":"这个人有三个苹果。"},{"key":"D","text":"这个人不喜欢苹果。"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"No, I do not 表示不喜欢。","verify":"\"这个人不喜欢苹果。\""},{"id":"cne_p053_q3","topicId":"cne_p053","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：I like bananas. I see four bananas. 有几根香蕉？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"4 根"},{"key":"B","text":"3 根"},{"key":"C","text":"5 根"},{"key":"D","text":"2 根"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"four 是 4。","verify":"\"4 根\""},{"id":"cne_p053_q4","topicId":"cne_p053","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：I have an orange. 这里的 orange 是什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"橙色"},{"key":"B","text":"橙子"},{"key":"C","text":"苹果"},{"key":"D","text":"梨"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"在水果这一课里 an orange 是一个橙子。","verify":"\"橙子\""}]
